{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20267xfqWA5CxT1792803382.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>港鐵東涌綫來往東涌站列車服務今晚提早收車。</p><p></p><p>為配合東涌延綫工程，由東涌站開出往香港站尾班車，提早在晚上11時02分開出，香港站往東涌最遲一班則是晚上11時07分。之後列車服務僅維持來往欣澳至香港站。</p><p></p><p>港鐵將在欣澳站提供免費接駁巴士來往東涌站，預計3至9分鐘一班。最後一班由欣澳開往東涌的接駁巴士是凌晨1時18分，港鐵指會加派人手及指示。機場快綫服務就不受影響。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T05:03:48.644619+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":180,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T04:36:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T05:07:02.622221+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T04:57:14.255104+00:00","content_hash":"e17bee05eb013200041f8f0fed412c00190d1676463609b1777aafeeedae0496","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-28T05:03:48.644619+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}